    "text": "<p>Manganate</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/78da0c65-87e3-48e4-aaa8-e9c7db48b81c-image.png\" style=\"width: 143px; height: 125px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;Paramagnetic, green in colour,<br />Tetrahedral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d&#960;</mi></math> bond</p><p>Permanganate</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>MnO</mi><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#920;</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7505b828-421e-4ee6-9caf-bf6c6b0e02c6-image.png\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 125px;\" /></p><p>Diamagnetic, purple in colour,<br />Tetrahedral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo></math> contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d&#960;</mi></math> bond&nbsp;</p>",
